00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.680
I'm on a 90-day health transformation program.

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:38.129
I'm trying to get to a certain shape that
I've never been before and I want to get to

00:04:38.129 --> 00:04:39.129
