00:04:39.129 --> 00:04:42.210
So every morning I post my pictures on what
I look like, and it's not the most comfortable

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.039
thing to do, but I want to get rid of this
gut.

00:04:44.039 --> 00:04:48.949
I want to get into very, very good shape,
just like I used to be at 21, 22 years old.

00:04:48.949 --> 00:04:51.810
And I'm starting to dialog a lot with people
that use Snapchat.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:56.650
[Why don't we pull up my Snapchat code so
other people can use it as well.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.650
And follow me on Snapchat.

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:59.479
I'm very active on Snapchat.]

00:04:59.479 --> 00:05:04.041
And I'm getting a lot of teenagers that would
message me and say, "Pat, can you do a video

00:05:04.041 --> 00:05:05.440
