00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.200
I'm 14-years old.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.539
I want to find out how to make money.

00:05:12.539 --> 00:05:13.539
How can you help me?"

00:05:13.539 --> 00:05:17.990
So the idea for this video came from Snapchat
because I got a message and I responded back

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:19.349
