00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:35.060
And he started giving me ideas about Snapchat.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.060
[Mario: Yes.]

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:42.719
Then I go to Florida and was spending time
with Phoebe, she is now I want to say 16 years

00:05:42.719 --> 00:05:46.050
old and for 30 minutes, she showed me Snapchat.

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:47.790
She's 16 years old, I'm 37 years old.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.520
She showed me Snapchat, right?

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:52.310
"Patrick do this, here's how this works, you
need to do this, you need to do that," and

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:55.949
we went through the whole thing together -- you
can do this and you can put your finger and

00:05:55.949 --> 00:05:56.949
do this.

00:05:56.949 --> 00:05:59.029
All these things she taught me, I know nothing
about it.

00:05:59.029 --> 00:06:00.889
And by the way, let me put it to you this
way.

00:06:00.889 --> 00:06:03.860
I would have paid $100 for that.

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:05.509
I would have paid $100 for that.

00:06:05.509 --> 00:06:09.210
You may be 13 years old and watching this
and say, Pat, c'mon now.

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:10.729
You'd pay $100 for that?

00:06:10.729 --> 00:06:11.729
Yes!

00:06:11.729 --> 00:06:12.729
Yes.

