00:07:45.129 --> 00:07:46.409
So what can you do on Fiverr?

00:07:46.409 --> 00:07:47.819
Here's what Fiverr's all about.

00:07:47.819 --> 00:07:48.819
You're a good writer?

00:07:48.819 --> 00:07:54.539
You say, "I edit blogs" for $20, for $10,
for $5, no problem.

00:07:54.539 --> 00:07:58.219
People start sending you postings so you start
